target: internal/plan/plan.go
verify: go test ./internal/plan/ -count=1 -run 'TestAReEntryIsSizedAgainstTheDelta'
expect: --- FAIL:
why:    the re-entry reason quotes the branch's size as the delta's, so a fast floor on a 400-line branch reads as if 400 lines were under the 30-line fast path
--- old
			c.delta, orEmpty(c.lastReviewed), c.semantic)
--- new
			c.semantic, orEmpty(c.lastReviewed), c.semantic)
